                <div class="subcard-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb" style="color:var(--accent-gold);"></i> Ideen
                  &amp; Vorschläge für Tag 19 <span class="sync-badge" style="margin-left:auto;"><span
                      class="sync-dot"></span> Verschlüsselt</span></div>
                <div class="sug-input-row">
                  <input type="text" class="sug-text-input" placeholder="Idee oder Tipp für Tag 19 vorschlagen..."
                    onkeypress="if(event.key==='Enter') addSuggestion('2027-04-08', this)">
                  <select class="sug-author-select">
                    <option>Tobi</option>
                    <option>Lara</option>
                    <option>Ker</option>
                    <option>Flo</option>
                  </select>
                  <button class="sug-btn-add" onclick="triggerAddSuggestion('2027-04-08', this)"><i
                      class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button>
                </div>
                <ul class="sug-list" id="sug-list-2027-04-08"></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>


          <!-- Tag 20 -->
          <details class="timeline-item" id="day-20">
            <summary class="timeline-summary">
              <div class="summary-header-row">
                <div class="timeline-header-badges">
                  <span class="timeline-day-badge">Tag 20</span>
                  <span class="date-badge">09.04. (Fr)</span>
                  <span class="drive-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-plane"></i> Rückflug MEL → VIE</span>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-day-map-link btn-unified-map-link" onclick="focusDayOnMap(20, event)"
                  title="Tag 20 auf der Karte zentrieren &amp; Route anzeigen"><i
                    class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot"></i> Auf Karte</button>
                <span class="expand-trigger"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i> Details</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="timeline-title">Rückflug nach Wien</h3>
            </summary>
            <div class="timeline-body">
              <div class="day-subcard">
                <div class="subcard-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Tagesprogramm</div>
                <p>Letzter Aussie-Flat-White am Morgen, Transfer zum Flughafen Melbourne Tullamarine (MEL) und Rückflug
                  nach Wien. Ende eines unvergesslichen Abenteuers!</p>
              </div>

              <!-- Detaillierter Tagesplan & Spots -->
              <details class="day-plan-accordion">
                <summary class="day-plan-summary">
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Detaillierter Tagesplan &amp; Spots</span>
                  <span class="plan-toggle-badge">Details ansehen <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
                </summary>
                <div class="day-plan-content">

                  <!-- A. Sightseeing-Highlights -->
                  <div class="day-plan-section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i> Sightseeing-Highlights &amp;
                    Fotospots</div>
                  <div class="sight-detail-grid">

                    <div class="sight-detail-card" id="spot-card-27" data-spot-id="27">
                      <div class="sight-header">
                        <h4 class="sight-name">Royal Botanic Gardens Victoria</h4>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-maps-mini btn-unified-map-link"
                          onclick="focusSpotOnMap(27, event)"
                          style="background: rgba(0, 109, 104, 0.12); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 109, 104, 0.25); cursor: pointer;"
                          title="Diesen Spot auf der Karte zentrieren"><i class="fa-solid fa-map-pin"></i> Auf
                          Karte</button> 
                      </div>
                      <div class="sight-detail-body">
                        <div class="sight-fact">
                          <span class="sight-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i> Was macht es besonders:</span>
                          <p>Eine der prachtvollsten Parkanlagen der Welt mit 8.500 Pflanzenarten und Ruheoasen.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="photo-spot-box">
                          <i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i>
                          <div><strong>Foto-Spot &amp; Zeit:</strong> Am Ufer des Ornamental Lake mit der spiegelnden
                            Trauerweide und den Seerosen. <span
                              style="font-weight:700; color:var(--primary); font-size:0.78rem;">(🌿 Vormittag)</span>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="sight-fact">
                          <span class="sight-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-route"></i> Wie man am besten hinkommt:</span>
                          <p>10 Min. Fußweg südlich von Federation Square über die Princes Bridge.</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <!-- B. Aktivitäten mit Uhrzeit -->
                  <div class="day-plan-section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> Zeitplanung &amp; Aktivitäten
                  </div>
                  <div class="activity-timeline" id="act-list-day-20">

                    <div class="activity-row">
                      <span class="activity-time">10:00</span>
                      <span class="activity-desc">Gemütliches letztes australisches Brekkie & Souvenirs packen</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="activity-row">
                      <span class="activity-time">13:00</span>
                      <span class="activity-desc">Check-out & Transfer zum Flughafen Melbourne Tullamarine (MEL)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="activity-row">
                      <span class="activity-time">16:30</span>
                      <span class="activity-desc">Heimflug Scoot TR 19 nach Singapur & Weiterflug nach Wien</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Vor-Ort Schnelleingabe -->
                  <div class="activity-inline-form">
                    <input type="time" class="act-time-input" id="act-time-day-20"
                      aria-label="Uhrzeit für neue Aktivität">
                    <input type="text" class="act-desc-input" id="act-desc-day-20"
                      placeholder="Neue Aktivität eintragen (z. B. 15:30 Eis essen)..."
                      onkeypress="if(event.key==='Enter') addCustomActivity(20)">
                    <button type="button" class="btn-act-add" onclick="addCustomActivity(20)"
                      title="Aktivität für Tag 20 hinzufügen">
                      <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Hinzufügen
                    </button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </details>
              <div class="day-subcard budget">
                <div class="subcard-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-wallet"></i> Rückflug Kosten</div>
                <ul class="sub-item-list">
                  <li><span>Langstreckenflug Melbourne → Wien (p.P.):</span> <strong>451 €</strong> <span
                      class="status-pill paid">Bezahlt</span></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="day-subcard suggestions" data-day="2027-04-09">
                <div class="subcard-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb" style="color:var(--accent-gold);"></i>
                  Notizen zur Abreise <span class="sync-badge" style="margin-left:auto;"><span class="sync-dot"></span>
                    Verschlüsselt</span></div>
                <div class="sug-input-row">
                  <input type="text" class="sug-text-input" placeholder="Souvenirs, Gepäck-Absprache..."
                    onkeypress="if(event.key==='Enter') addSuggestion('2027-04-09', this)">
                  <select class="sug-author-select">
                    <option>Tobi</option>
                    <option>Lara</option>
                    <option>Ker</option>
                    <option>Flo</option>
                  </select>
                  <button class="sug-btn-add" onclick="triggerAddSuggestion('2027-04-09', this)"><i
                      class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button>
                </div>
                <ul class="sug-list" id="sug-list-2027-04-09"></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Budgetübersicht -->
    <section id="budget" class="section-spaced">
      <h2 class="section-title">Kosten- & Budgetübersicht (4 Personen)</h2>

      <details class="clean-slide" id="budget-details-slide">
        <summary>
          <div class="slide-icon-title">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-coins" style="color: var(--primary);"></i>
            <span>Details</span>
          </div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down chevron-rot"></i>
        </summary>
        <div class="slide-content" style="padding: 1.5rem 1.4rem;">

          <div class="budget-toggle-wrapper">
            <span class="budget-toggle-label">Gesamtkosten (4 Pers.)</span>
            <label class="budget-switch">
              <input type="checkbox" id="person-toggle" onchange="updateBudgetCalculations()" checked>
              <span class="budget-slider"></span>
              <span id="toggle-dot" class="budget-slider-dot"></span>
            </label>
            <span class="budget-toggle-label">Kosten pro Person</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Zentrales Budget-Dashboard: KPI Metriken (Gruppe vs. Person) -->
          <div class="budget-kpi-grid">
            <div class="budget-kpi-card">
              <div class="budget-kpi-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-wallet" style="color:var(--primary);"></i>
                Gesamtbudget</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-val" id="kpi-total-budget">3.408 €</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-sub" id="kpi-total-sub"><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i> pro Person (13.632 €
                Gruppe)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="budget-kpi-card">
              <div class="budget-kpi-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-list" style="color:#0284c7;"></i> Geplante
                Kosten</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-val" id="kpi-planned-cost">2.608 €</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-sub" id="kpi-planned-sub">Fixe Reiseetappen</div>
            </div>

            <div class="budget-kpi-card">
              <div class="budget-kpi-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-receipt" style="color:#10b981;"></i> Bisher ausgegeben
              </div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-val" id="kpi-actual-spent">1.093 €</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-sub" id="kpi-actual-sub">Gebucht &amp; Vor Ort</div>
            </div>

            <div class="budget-kpi-card">
              <div class="budget-kpi-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-piggy-bank" style="color:var(--secondary);"></i>
                Verbleibend</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-val" id="kpi-remaining-budget" style="color:var(--secondary);">2.315 €</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-sub" id="kpi-remaining-sub">Noch verfügbar</div>
            </div>

            <div class="budget-kpi-card">
              <div class="budget-kpi-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line" style="color:#8b5cf6;"></i> Ø Kosten / Tag
              </div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-val" id="kpi-daily-avg">170 € / Tag</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-sub" id="kpi-daily-sub">Kalkuliert auf 20 Tage</div>
            </div>

            <div class="budget-kpi-card">
              <div class="budget-kpi-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check" style="color:#d97706;"></i>
                Verbleibend / Tag</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-val" id="kpi-daily-remaining">116 € / Tag</div>
              <div class="budget-kpi-sub" id="kpi-daily-rem-sub">Tagesbudget für Restzeit</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 1. Interaktive D3.js Diagramme: 3 Ansichten (Kategorie, Tag, Geplant vs. Tatsächlich) -->
          <div class="hub-card budget-chart-card" id="budget-charts-main-card">
            <div
              style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem;">
              <div class="budget-chart-tabs" role="tablist">
                <button type="button" class="budget-chart-tab-btn active" id="tab-btn-cat"
                  onclick="switchBudgetChartTab('cat')">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie"></i> Nach Kategorie
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="budget-chart-tab-btn" id="tab-btn-daily"
                  onclick="switchBudgetChartTab('daily')">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-simple"></i> Kosten pro Tag (1–20)
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="budget-chart-tab-btn" id="tab-btn-vs" onclick="switchBudgetChartTab('vs')">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced"></i> Geplant vs. Tatsächlich
                </button>
              </div>

              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <span id="chart-sub-mode"
                  style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); background: var(--primary-light); padding: 0.22rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 999px;">
                  Kosten pro Person
                </span>

              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab 1: Donut nach Kategorie -->
            <div id="chart-view-cat" class="budget-chart-view-panel">
              <div class="doughnut-container-grid">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
                  <div id="budget-doughnut-svg-wrap"
                    style="position: relative; width: 280px; height: 280px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                    <div id="budget-doughnut-svg-container" style="width: 280px; height: 280px;"></div>
                    <div id="budget-doughnut-center-content" class="doughnut-center-overlay">
                      <div id="chart-center-sub"
                        style="font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
                        Gesamtkosten</div>
                      <div id="chart-center-val"
                        style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin: 0.15rem 0;">2.608
                        €</div>
                      <div id="chart-center-pct" style="font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary);">
                        Kosten p.P.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="doughnut-legend-col" id="budget-doughnut-legend">
                  <!-- Dynamically generated via renderBudgetDoughnutChart -->
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab 2: Kosten pro Tag (Tag 1–20) -->
            <div id="chart-view-daily" class="budget-chart-view-panel" style="display:none;">
              <div
                style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.75rem; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem;">
                <div style="font-size:0.84rem; color:var(--text-muted);">Ausgabenverteilung über die 20 Reisetage (Klick
                  auf Balken öffnet Tag):</div>
                <div style="display:flex; gap:0.8rem; font-size:0.76rem; font-weight:700;">
                  <span style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.35rem;"><span
                      style="width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:2px; background:#006d68; display:inline-block;"></span>
                    Geplant</span>
                  <span style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.35rem;"><span
                      style="width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:2px; background:#f59e0b; display:inline-block;"></span>
                    Bisher erfasst</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="budget-daily-chart-container" style="width:100%; min-height:260px; position:relative;"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab 3: Geplant vs. Tatsächlich -->
            <div id="chart-view-vs" class="budget-chart-view-panel" style="display:none;">
              <div
                style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.75rem; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem;">
                <div style="font-size:0.84rem; color:var(--text-muted);">Soll-Ist-Vergleich aller 8 Budget-Kategorien:
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex; gap:0.8rem; font-size:0.76rem; font-weight:700;">
                  <span style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.35rem;"><span
                      style="width:12px; height:6px; border-radius:2px; background:rgba(100,116,139,0.4); display:inline-block;"></span>
                    Geplantes Budget</span>
                  <span style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.35rem;"><span
                      style="width:12px; height:6px; border-radius:2px; background:var(--primary); display:inline-block;"></span>
                    Tatsächlich ausgegeben</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div id="budget-vs-chart-container" style="width:100%; min-height:280px; position:relative;"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Universal Tooltip Container -->
            <div id="d3-chart-universal-tooltip" class="d3-chart-tooltip"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- 2. Ausgaben-Tracker: Erfassen, Bearbeiten & Löschen aller 8 Kategorien -->
          <div class="hub-card expense-tracker-card" id="expense-tracker-card">
            <div class="expense-toolbar">
              <div>
                <h3
                  style="margin: 0; color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.15rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem;">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-receipt" style="color: var(--secondary);"></i>
                  Ausgaben-Tracker &amp; Belege
                </h3>
                <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.2rem;">
                  Ausgaben für alle 8 Kategorien in AUD oder EUR erfassen, live umrechnen &amp; aufteilen
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <button type="button" class="btn-add-expense" onclick="openExpenseModal(null)">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Ausgabe hinzufügen
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Filters bar -->
            <div
              style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">
              <div class="expense-filters">
                <select id="expense-filter-cat" class="expense-filter-select" onchange="renderExpenseList()">
                  <option value="all">Alle Kategorien (8)</option>
                  <option value="flights">✈️ Flüge</option>
                  <option value="hotels">🏨 Unterkunft</option>
                  <option value="car">🚗 Mietwagen</option>
                  <option value="fuel">⛽ Benzin</option>
                  <option value="food">🍽️ Essen &amp; Drinks</option>
                  <option value="activities">🎟️ Aktivitäten</option>
                  <option value="groceries">🛒 Einkäufe</option>
                  <option value="misc">📦 Sonstiges</option>
                </select>

                <select id="expense-filter-payer" class="expense-filter-select" onchange="renderExpenseList()">
                  <option value="all">Alle Personen</option>
                  <option value="Gruppe">Gruppe (Alle)</option>
                  <option value="Tobi">Tobi</option>
                  <option value="Lara">Lara</option>
                  <option value="Ker">Ker</option>
                  <option value="Flo">Flo</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div id="expense-count-summary" style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted);">
                0 Ausgaben erfasst
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Expense List -->
            <div id="expense-items-list" class="expense-list-wrap">
              <!-- Dynamically populated via renderExpenseList() -->
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Modal: Ausgabe erfassen / bearbeiten -->
          <div id="expense-modal-backdrop" class="expense-modal-backdrop"
            onclick="if(event.target===this) closeExpenseModal()">
            <div class="expense-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="expense-modal-title-text">
              <div class="expense-modal-header">
                <div class="expense-modal-title">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square" style="color:var(--primary);"></i>
                  <span id="expense-modal-title-text">Ausgabe erfassen</span>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="expense-modal-close" onclick="closeExpenseModal()" aria-label="Schließen">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
                </button>
              </div>

              <form id="expense-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); saveExpenseFromModal();">
                <input type="hidden" id="exp-edit-id" value="">

                <div class="expense-form-row">
                  <label for="exp-input-title">Titel / Notiz *</label>
                  <input type="text" id="exp-input-title" class="expense-form-input"
                    placeholder="z. B. Abendessen Darling Harbour..." required>
                </div>

                <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:0.6rem;">
                  <div class="expense-form-row">
                    <label for="exp-input-date">Datum *</label>
                    <input type="date" id="exp-input-date" class="expense-form-input" required>
                  </div>

                  <div class="expense-form-row">
                    <label for="exp-input-cat">Kategorie *</label>
                    <select id="exp-input-cat" class="expense-form-select" required>
                      <option value="flights">✈️ Flüge</option>
                      <option value="hotels">🏨 Unterkunft</option>
                      <option value="car">🚗 Mietwagen</option>
                      <option value="fuel">⛽ Benzin</option>
                      <option value="food">🍽️ Essen &amp; Drinks</option>
                      <option value="activities">🎟️ Aktivitäten</option>
                      <option value="groceries">🛒 Einkäufe</option>
                      <option value="misc">📦 Sonstiges</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:0.6rem;">
                  <div class="expense-form-row">
                    <label for="exp-input-amount">Betrag *</label>
                    <input type="number" id="exp-input-amount" class="expense-form-input" placeholder="0.00" step="0.01"
                      min="0.01" required oninput="updateExpenseModalPreview()">
                  </div>

                  <div class="expense-form-row">
                    <label for="exp-input-curr">Währung *</label>
                    <select id="exp-input-curr" class="expense-form-select" onchange="updateExpenseModalPreview()">
                      <option value="EUR">Euro (€)</option>
                      <option value="AUD">Australischer Dollar (A$)</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:0.6rem;">
                  <div class="expense-form-row">
                    <label for="exp-input-payer">Bezahlt von *</label>
                    <select id="exp-input-payer" class="expense-form-select">
                      <option value="Gruppe">Gruppe (Gemeinsam)</option>
                      <option value="Tobi">Tobi</option>
                      <option value="Lara">Lara</option>
                      <option value="Ker">Ker</option>
                      <option value="Flo">Flo</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>

                  <div class="expense-form-row">
                    <label for="exp-input-persons">Anzahl Personen *</label>
                    <input type="number" id="exp-input-persons" class="expense-form-input" min="1" max="20" value="4"
                      required oninput="updateExpenseModalPreview()">
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Preview converted amount -->
                <div id="exp-modal-preview"
                  style="font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--text-muted); background:var(--card-sub-bg); padding:0.5rem 0.75rem; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--border-color); margin-top:0.4rem;">
                  Entspricht: <strong>0,00 €</strong> / 0,00 AUD
                </div>

                <div class="expense-modal-footer">
                  <button type="button" class="btn-dash-action secondary"
                    onclick="closeExpenseModal()">Abbrechen</button>
                  <button type="submit" class="btn-dash-action primary">Speichern</button>
                </div>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 2. Vor-Ort Budget / Taschengeld-Planer (Australien) -->
          <div class="hub-card onsite-budget-card">
            <div
              style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
              <h3
                style="margin: 0; color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders" style="color: var(--accent-gold);"></i>
                Vor-Ort Budget (Taschengeld Australien)
              </h3>
              <span
                style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--card-sub-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 999px;">
                20 Tage Roadtrip
              </span>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.9rem;">
              Stelle manuell ein, wie viel Geld du vor Ort in Australien ausgeben möchtest (Essen, Drinks, Snacks &
              Spesen):
            </p>

            <div class="onsite-control-row">
              <!-- Compact Number Input -->
              <div
                style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; background: var(--card-sub-bg); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 12px; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; width: fit-content;">
                <label for="onsite-spend-input"
                  style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); margin-right: 0.2rem;">Budget:</label>
                <input type="number" id="onsite-spend-input" min="0" max="10000" step="25" value="800"
                  style="width: 80px; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--text-main); outline: none; text-align: right;"
                  oninput="updateOnsiteSpend(this.value, 'input')">
                <span style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); font-size: 1rem;">€</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Interactive Slider Bar -->
              <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 190px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem;">
                <input type="range" id="onsite-spend-slider" min="0" max="3000" step="25" value="800"
                  class="budget-bar-range" oninput="updateOnsiteSpend(this.value, 'slider')">
                <div
                  style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600;">
                  <span>0 €</span>
                  <span>1.000 €</span>
                  <span>2.000 €</span>
                  <span>3.000 €</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Small Overview Metrics -->
            <div
              style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem; padding-top: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-color);">
              <div
                style="background: var(--card-sub-bg); padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                <span
                  style="display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase;">Tagesbudget:</span>
                <strong id="onsite-daily-eur" style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--primary);">40 € / Tag</strong>
              </div>
              <div
                style="background: var(--card-sub-bg); padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                <span
                  style="display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase;">In
                  AUD (vor Ort):</span>
                <strong id="onsite-total-aud" style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--secondary);">ca. 1.288 AUD</strong>
              </div>
              <div
                style="background: var(--card-sub-bg); padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                <span
                  style="display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase;">Gesamt
                  p.P. inkl. Taschengeld:</span>
                <strong id="onsite-total-trip" style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--primary);">ca. 3.408 €</strong>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Quick Choice Preset Chips -->
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 0.85rem;">
              <span
                style="font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); margin-right: 0.2rem;">Schnellwahl:</span>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setOnsiteSpend(400)">400 € (Sparsam • 20€/Tag)</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setOnsiteSpend(800)">800 € (Klassisch • 40€/Tag)</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setOnsiteSpend(1200)">1.200 € (Komfort • 60€/Tag)</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setOnsiteSpend(1800)">1.800 € (Genießer •
                90€/Tag)</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3. Gemeinsame Reisekasse (Splitwise) - Minimalistischer Link-Zugang -->
          <div class="hub-card reisekasse-budget-card" id="reisekasse-budget-card"
            style="margin-bottom: 2rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;">
            <div
              style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.8rem;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem;">
                <div
                  style="width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(30, 185, 128, 0.12); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #1eb980; font-size: 1.25rem;">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-sack-dollar"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin: 0; color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.05rem;">Gemeinsame Reisekasse (Splitwise)
                  </h3>
                  <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Gruppe für Tobi, Lara, Ker & Flo</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a id="link-splitwise-budget" href="#" target="_blank" class="btn-tool splitwise splitwise-btn"
                style="text-decoration: none; padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 12px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> Geschützte Splitwise Gruppe
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 4. Spritrechner & Tankbelege (Live-Sync über alle Geräte) -->
          <div class="hub-card" id="fuel-budget-card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            <div
              style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">
              <h3
                style="margin: 0; color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.15rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-gas-pump" style="color: var(--secondary);"></i>
                Spritrechner & Tankbelege
              </h3>
              <span class="sync-badge"><span class="sync-dot"></span> E2EE Live-Sync</span>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.9rem;">
              Kosten pro Tankfüllung eintragen, Zahler (Ker, Tobi, Flo oder Lara) auswählen und live über alle Geräte
              synchronisieren:
            </p>

            <!-- Quick Add Chips -->
            <div class="quick-add-chips" style="margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setFuelAmount(50)">+ 50 AUD</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setFuelAmount(75)">+ 75 AUD</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setFuelAmount(90)">+ 90 AUD</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setFuelAmount(110)">+ 110 AUD</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setFuelAmount(130)">+ 130 AUD</button>
            </div>

            <div class="grocery-input-group" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.55rem;">
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; width: 100%;">
                <div style="position: relative; flex: 1;">
                  <input type="number" id="fuel-cost-aud" class="grocery-input"
                    style="width: 100%; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; padding-right: 3.5rem;"
                    placeholder="Betrag in AUD..." step="0.01" oninput="updateFuelEurPreview()"
                    onkeypress="if(event.key === 'Enter') addFuelEntry()">
                  <span
                    style="position: absolute; right: 0.8rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--secondary); pointer-events: none;">AUD</span>
                </div>
                <select id="fuel-payer" class="grocery-input"
                  style="width: 120px; flex: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.92rem; background: var(--card-sub-bg); cursor: pointer;"
                  title="Wer hat bezahlt?">
                  <option value="Ker">Ker</option>
                  <option value="Tobi" selected>Tobi</option>
                  <option value="Flo">Flo</option>
                  <option value="Lara">Lara</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; width: 100%;">
                <input type="text" id="fuel-location" class="grocery-input" style="flex: 1;"
                  placeholder="Tankstelle / Ort / Liter (optional, z.B. BP Coffs Harbour, 45L)..."
                  onkeypress="if(event.key === 'Enter') addFuelEntry()">
                <button type="button" class="grocery-btn-add"
                  style="flex: none; width: auto; padding: 0 1.1rem; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem;"
                  onclick="addFuelEntry()">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Hinzufügen
                </button>
              </div>

              <!-- Preview hint -->
              <div id="fuel-eur-preview" style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0.1rem 0.2rem;">
                Entspricht ca. 0,00 € (Kurs: 1 AUD ≈ 0,62 EUR) • Wird fair durch 4 geteilt
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Summary Totals -->
            <div
              style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.65rem; margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">
              <div
                style="background: var(--card-sub-bg); padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                <span
                  style="display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Gesamtkosten
                  Sprit:</span>
                <strong id="fuel-total-sum" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--primary);">0,00 AUD (0 €)</strong>
              </div>
              <div
                style="background: var(--card-sub-bg); padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                <span
                  style="display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Kosten
                  p.P. (÷ 4):</span>
                <strong id="fuel-per-person" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--secondary);">0,00 AUD (0
                  €)</strong>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Breakdown per Payer (Ker, Tobi, Flo, Lara) -->
            <div style="margin-bottom: 0.85rem;">
              <span
                style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Bisher
                bezahlt (nach Person):</span>
              <div class="breakdown-grid">
                <div class="breakdown-cell"><span class="payer-badge ker">Ker</span><strong id="fuel-ker-sum">0
                    €</strong><small id="fuel-ker-aud"
                    style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: block;">0 AUD</small></div>
                <div class="breakdown-cell"><span class="payer-badge tobi">Tobi</span><strong id="fuel-tobi-sum">0
                    €</strong><small id="fuel-tobi-aud"
                    style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: block;">0 AUD</small></div>
                <div class="breakdown-cell"><span class="payer-badge flo">Flo</span><strong id="fuel-flo-sum">0
                    €</strong><small id="fuel-flo-aud"
                    style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: block;">0 AUD</small></div>
                <div class="breakdown-cell"><span class="payer-badge lara">Lara</span><strong id="fuel-lara-sum">0
                    €</strong><small id="fuel-lara-aud"
                    style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: block;">0 AUD</small></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Entries List -->
            <div
              style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span
                style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Eingetragene
                Tankfüllungen:</span>
              <span id="fuel-entry-count" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600;">0
                Einträge</span>
            </div>
            <div id="fuel-list-container">
              <!-- Dynamically populated -->
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 4. Supermarkt-Einkaufszettel (Coles & Woolies) -->
          <div class="hub-card" id="grocery-budget-card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            <div
              style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">
              <h3
                style="margin: 0; color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.15rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping" style="color: var(--secondary);"></i>
                Supermarkt-Einkaufszettel (Coles & Woolies)
              </h3>
              <span class="sync-badge"><span class="sync-dot"></span> E2EE Live</span>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.9rem;">
              Einkäufe für die Gruppe eintragen, Kosten in AUD umrechnen und live auf Tobi, Lara, Ker und Flo aufteilen:
            </p>

            <div class="quick-add-chips">
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="quickAddGrocery('24er Pack Trinkwasser')">+ 24er
                Trinkwasser</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="quickAddGrocery('Eisbeutel für Kühlbox (Esky)')">+
                Eisbeutel (Esky)</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="quickAddGrocery('Toastbrot & Butter')">+ Toast &
                Butter</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="quickAddGrocery('BBQ Fleisch / Würstel')">+ BBQ
                Fleisch</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="quickAddGrocery('Bushman Mückenspray')">+
                Mückenspray</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="quickAddGrocery('Tim Tams Double Coat')">+ Tim
                Tams</button>
            </div>

            <div class="grocery-input-group">
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; width: 100%;">
                <input type="text" id="grocery-item-input" class="grocery-input" placeholder="Artikel eingeben..."
                  onkeypress="if(event.key === 'Enter') addGroceryItem()">
              </div>
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; width: 100%;">
                <input type="number" id="grocery-price-aud" class="grocery-input" style="flex: 1;"
                  placeholder="Betrag in AUD (optional)" step="0.01">
                <select id="grocery-payer" class="grocery-input" style="width: 110px; flex: none; font-weight: 700;">
                  <option value="Tobi">Tobi</option>
                  <option value="Lara">Lara</option>
                  <option value="Ker">Ker</option>
                  <option value="Flo">Flo</option>
                </select>
                <button type="button" class="grocery-btn-add" onclick="addGroceryItem()"><i
                    class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="breakdown-grid" style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">
              <div class="breakdown-cell">Tobi: <strong id="grocery-tobi-sum">0 €</strong></div>
              <div class="breakdown-cell">Lara: <strong id="grocery-lara-sum">0 €</strong></div>
              <div class="breakdown-cell">Ker: <strong id="grocery-ker-sum">0 €</strong></div>
              <div class="breakdown-cell">Flo: <strong id="grocery-flo-sum">0 €</strong></div>
            </div>

            <ul id="grocery-list-container" class="grocery-list"></ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Live Währungsrechner (AUD ↔ EUR) -->
          <div class="hub-card currency-converter-card">
            <div
              style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
              <h3
                style="margin: 0; color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-calculator" style="color: var(--secondary);"></i>
                Währungsrechner (AUD ↔ EUR)
              </h3>
              <div id="currency-rate-badge"
                style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--card-sub-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 999px;">
                <span class="sync-dot"
                  style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #16a34a; display: inline-block;"></span>
                <span id="currency-rate-text">1 AUD ≈ 0,621 EUR</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Inputs row -->
            <div class="converter-inputs-grid">

              <!-- AUD Input -->
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem;">
                <label for="conv-aud-input"
                  style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
                  <span>Australischer Dollar (AUD)</span>
                  <span style="color: var(--secondary); font-weight: 800;">🇦🇺 A$</span>
                </label>
                <div class="conv-input-wrap">
                  <input type="number" id="conv-aud-input" class="grocery-input"
                    style="width: 100%; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.7rem 2.8rem 0.7rem 0.9rem;"
                    placeholder="0.00" step="any" value="100">
                  <span class="conv-currency-badge">AUD</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Swap Button -->
              <div class="conv-swap-cell"
                style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-end; padding-top: 1.25rem;">
                <button type="button" id="conv-swap-btn" class="conv-swap-btn" title="Richtung wechseln"
                  onclick="swapCurrencies()">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-arrow-left"></i>
                </button>
              </div>

              <!-- EUR Input -->
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem;">
                <label for="conv-eur-input"
                  style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
                  <span>Euro (EUR)</span>
                  <span style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 800;">🇪🇺 €</span>
                </label>
                <div class="conv-input-wrap">
                  <input type="number" id="conv-eur-input" class="grocery-input"
                    style="width: 100%; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.7rem 2.8rem 0.7rem 0.9rem;"
                    placeholder="0.00" step="any" value="62.09">
                  <span class="conv-currency-badge">EUR</span>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>

            <!-- Quick presets & Market rate info -->
            <div
              style="margin-top: 1rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-color); padding-top: 0.85rem;">
              <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; align-items: center;">
                <span
                  style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); margin-right: 0.2rem;">Schnellwahl:</span>
                <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setCalcAud(5)">5 AUD (Kaffee)</button>
                <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setCalcAud(25)">25 AUD (Lunch)</button>
                <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setCalcAud(50)">50 AUD (Einkauf)</button>
                <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setCalcAud(100)">100 AUD (Tanken)</button>
                <button type="button" class="chip-btn" onclick="setCalcAud(250)">250 AUD (Tour)</button>
              </div>

              <div
                style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem;">
                <span id="currency-update-time">Marktkurs live</span>
                <button type="button" onclick="fetchExchangeRates(true)" title="Kurs jetzt aktualisieren"
                  style="background: none; border: none; color: var(--primary); cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 0.2rem;">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate" id="currency-refresh-icon"></i>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- 2x2 Grid -->
          <div class="budget-grid-2x2">
            <div class="hub-card budget-category-card">
              <div>
                <h3 style="margin:0;"><i class="fa-solid fa-plane"></i> Flüge</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Alle Flugverbindungen (Gebucht)</p>
                <ul class="sub-item-list">
                  <li class="sub-price-item" data-item-id="flight-1" data-eur="453" data-paid="true"><span>Wien →
                      Sydney:</span>
                    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center;"><strong class="sub-price-val">453 €</strong> <label
                        class="paid-toggle-btn" title="Klicken: Geplant ↔ Gebucht &amp; bezahlt"><input type="checkbox"
                          class="sub-paid-cb" data-id="flight-1" checked
                          onchange="toggleSubItemPaid('flight-1', this.checked)"><span
                          class="paid-status-pill is-paid"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Gebucht &amp;
                          bezahlt</span></label></div>
                  </li>
                  <li class="sub-price-item" data-item-id="flight-2" data-eur="54" data-paid="true"><span>Sydney →
                      Ballina:</span>
                    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center;"><strong class="sub-price-val">54 €</strong> <label
                        class="paid-toggle-btn" title="Klicken: Geplant ↔ Gebucht &amp; bezahlt"><input type="checkbox"
                          class="sub-paid-cb" data-id="flight-2" checked
                          onchange="toggleSubItemPaid('flight-2', this.checked)"><span
                          class="paid-status-pill is-paid"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Gebucht &amp;
                          bezahlt</span></label></div>
                  </li>
                  <li class="sub-price-item" data-item-id="flight-3" data-eur="135" data-paid="true"><span>Proserpine →
                      Melbourne:</span>
                    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center;"><strong class="sub-price-val">135 €</strong> <label
                        class="paid-toggle-btn" title="Klicken: Geplant ↔ Gebucht &amp; bezahlt"><input type="checkbox"
                          class="sub-paid-cb" data-id="flight-3" checked
                          onchange="toggleSubItemPaid('flight-3', this.checked)"><span
                          class="paid-status-pill is-paid"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Gebucht &amp;
                          bezahlt</span></label></div>
                  </li>
                  <li class="sub-price-item" data-item-id="flight-4" data-eur="451" data-paid="true"><span>Melbourne →
                      Wien:</span>
                    <div style="display:flex; align-items:center;"><strong class="sub-price-val">451 €</strong> <label
                        class="paid-toggle-btn" title="Klicken: Geplant ↔ Gebucht &amp; bezahlt"><input type="checkbox"
                          class="sub-paid-cb" data-id="flight-4" checked
                          onchange="toggleSubItemPaid('flight-4', this.checked)"><span
                          class="paid-status-pill is-paid"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Gebucht &amp;
                          bezahlt</span></label></div>
                  </li>
                </ul>
